    {
      "text": "In a small cup combine the salt, pepper, olive oil and milk. Mix well and pour the mixture into a 9x13 inch baking dish. Add the cubed chicken and cover with cornflake crumbs. Bake in the preheated oven for 25 minutes, until the crumbs are crisp.",
